            <div xml:id="d725">

                <pb facs="0864" n="770" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg770"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to Mr. Uhl.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate-General</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic">July 27,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2543.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Herewith I inclose a copy of a letter dated
                    the 25th instant at “West Tampa, Fla., and addressed to me with a draft of $150
                    on the Bank of the Republic, “New York, by Messrs. Theodore Perez &amp; Co. for
                    delivery to Mr. Julio Sanguily, at the Fortress Cabana, this city. I return the
                    said letter and draft, with the respectful request that the Department return
                    them to Messrs. Theodore Perez &amp; Co. with the suggestion that those
                    gentlemen forward them direct to Mr. Sanguily, as this office ought not to take
                    charge of his private correspondence, unless otherwise directed by the
                    Department.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ramon O. Williams</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consul-General.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d725-a1.xml" xpointer="d725-a1"/>
            </div>
